  <!-- EN: Experimentation -->
  <RimpsycheUseExperimentation>实验精神</RimpsycheUseExperimentation>
  <!-- EN: Pawns may experiment while crafting or building, either increasing or decreasing an item's quality. -->
  <RimpsycheUseExperimentationTooltip>角色在制造或建造时可能会进行试验，会提升或者降低品质。</RimpsycheUseExperimentationTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Sense of Progress -->
  <RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgress>进步感</RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgress>
  <!-- EN: Pawns gain a mood boost from progress like earning skill XP, making quality items, or completing research. Ambitious pawns may become frustrated if they go too long without making progress. -->
  <RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgressTooltip>角色会从获得技能经验、制作高品质物品或完成研究等进展中获得心情加成。有雄心的角色如果长时间没有进展可能会闷闷不乐。</RimpsycheUseSenseOfProgressTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Resilient Spirit -->
  <RimpsycheUseResilientSpirit>坚韧不拔</RimpsycheUseResilientSpirit>
  <!-- EN: Resilient pawns has a chance to resist mentalbreaks and gain renewed resolve buff for three days instead. (Cooldown 60 days) -->
  <RimpsycheUseResilientSpiritTooltip>坚韧不拔的小人有机会抵抗精神崩溃，转而获得持续三天的发奋图强增益。（冷却时间60天）</RimpsycheUseResilientSpiritTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Hide in Shame -->
  <RimpsycheUseHideInShame>无地自容</RimpsycheUseHideInShame>
  <!-- EN: Modest pawns not dressed according to their ideology (naked for vanilla) will feel ashamed, and can eventually run away in shame from other pawns' prying eyes. -->
  <RimpsycheUseHideInShameTooltip>端庄的小人若如果未按其文化着装（原版则为裸体）会感到羞愧，并最终可能想躲避他人的眼神而羞愧逃跑。</RimpsycheUseHideInShameTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Tend over Shame -->
  <RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShame>治疗优先于羞愧</RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShame>
  <!-- EN: Pawns with health conditions suppress their shame until they are tended. -->
  <RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShameTooltip>有健康状况的小人会压制自己的羞愧感，直到得到治疗。</RimpsycheCheckMedicalOverShameTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Fight-or-flight -->
  <RimpsycheUseFightorFlight>战斗或逃跑反应</RimpsycheUseFightorFlight>
  <!-- EN: In combat, fearful pawns may suffer panic attacks, while brave or aggressive pawns may get an adrenaline rush that temporarily boosts stats. -->
  <RimpsycheUseFightorFlightTooltip>战斗中，缩头缩脑的角色可能会遭受恐慌发作，而勇敢或者好斗的角色可能会肾上腺素激增，暂时提升属性。</RimpsycheUseFightorFlightTooltip>
  <!-- EN: Non-colonists Fight-or-flight -->
  <RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlight>非殖民者的战斗或逃跑反应</RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlight>
  <!-- EN: Non-colonists may experience panic attacks or adrenaline rushes. -->
  <RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlightTooltip>非殖民者可能会经历恐慌发作或肾上腺素激增。</RimpsycheEnemyFightorFlightTooltip>

